        "section": "coatings",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Wood Stains",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n  Oil carrier (linseed, tung, alkyd, mineral spirits, water)\n  + pigment/dye\n  Soaks into wood cell walls and pores\n  Carrier evaporates/polymerizes in wood\n  Pigment/dye trapped in wood fibers"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-WOOD-STAINS.md#014",
      "path": [
        "03-WOOD-STAINS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
