        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Wood Stains",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "RESULT:\n    Color: yes (from colorant)\n    Film on surface: NO (no film to peel, crack, bubble)\n    Texture: shows all wood texture, grain, and sanding scratches\n    Protection: oil in wood = some UV and moisture resistance\n    Maintenance: when worn, can apply more penetrating stain directly\n                 (no film to remove or sand back through)"
    },
