        "title": "Wood Stains",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "WHY PENETRATING STAINS ARE USED:\n    Rough-sawn wood (can't get film to adhere well to very rough surface)\n    Log cabins, weathered decks (where film would trap moisture)\n    When periodic maintenance by homeowner is expected\n    Where film-forming stain has previously failed and peeled\n```"
    },
