      "text": "```\nSEMI-TRANSPARENT STAIN:\n  Shows grain and texture\n  Thin film forms on surface\n  Some hiding of imperfections\n  Best of both: color + some protection\n  Most popular choice for maintenance: when old film fails,\n  requires stripping to solid/bare wood\n  Deck stains at this level: 1-2 year reapplication cycle typical"
    },
