      },
      "text": "SOLID STAIN:\n  Essentially paint — full opacity\n  No grain visible\n  Maximum protection (thick film, UV block, water barrier)\n  Peels like paint when film fails\n  Hardest to maintain: stripping required before recoating\n  Use when: wood condition is poor and you need to hide it\n            + when longevity > appearance is priority"
    }
